---
description: Security agent triages Snyk and opens fix pull requests
alwaysApply: false
---

Use this rule when the task is labeled agent:security.

Read Snyk findings and fix critical and high issues in application code, Playwright tests, or existing Terraform modules. Do not edit `docs/security/waivers`. Do not change production IAM, the GitHub OIDC trust policy, or Amazon Cognito. A finding you cannot fix stays open and blocks promotion.
